Ontology(<http://example.org/mat2.owl>

Declaration(Class(<http://example.org/A>))
Declaration(Class(<http://example.org/B>))
Declaration(Class(<http://example.org/D>))
Declaration(ObjectProperty(<http://example.org/p>))

############################
#   Classes
############################

# Class: <http://example.org/A> (<http://example.org/A>)

EquivalentClasses(<http://example.org/A> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://example.org/B> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://example.org/p> <http://example.org/D>)))
SubClassOf(<http://example.org/A> <http://example.org/B>)
SubClassOf(<http://example.org/A> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://example.org/p> <http://example.org/D>))


)